        "Author mechanical preflight 不产生 Reviewer Verdict、不创建 next authority",
        "人类可读 Agent narrative 默认简体中文；machine literals 保持 exact"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Architecture Description continuity",
      "items": [
        "Accepted Actual(n) 连续确认 Current(n+1)；Planned 基于 Current + formal Delivery intent",
        "Current→Planned、Current→Actual、Planned→Actual 都采用左旧右新的双栏页面",
        "每一侧由同一 managed Archify 从对应 Description 独立生成；Pair descriptor 只保存左右ref/hash",
        "不增加delta第三栏或semantic comparator；Actual服从final facts，HTML只是derived local presentation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Engineering health / cross-platform",
      "items": [
        "new/changed code 建立 incremental quality admission；历史 unchanged debt 不阻塞无关 Change",
        "只对 proven responsibility hotspot 做 bounded refactor；high-impact work 需要 impact proof",
        "CodeGraph 可选且无 authority；CRLF/exact-byte fingerprint correctness 必须显式证明 closed 或 correction"
      ]
    }
